E0120 foreign.lc:3:3 no `let`: write `x = 1` (immutable) or `var x = 0` (mutable) | fix: var y = 0
E0126 foreign.lc:4:5 no `:=`; write `x = 1` (immutable) or `var x = 0` (mutable) | fix: z = 3
E0127 foreign.lc:5:4 no `++`/`--`; write `x += 1`
E0142 foreign.lc:6:3 no C-style for; write `for i in 0..n:`
E0133 foreign.lc:8:14 no comprehensions; use `xs.filter(cond).map(expr)` with `it`
E0135 foreign.lc:9:4 bindings are not annotated; write `x = value`, or `var x T = value` when the type is needed
E0124 foreign.lc:10:13 `//` is not an operator: comments start with `#`; integer `/` already truncates
E0125 foreign.lc:11:13 no `::` paths; use `.`, e.g. `Shape.Circle(1.0)`
E0123 foreign.lc:12:12 blocks use `:` and indentation, not braces
E0129 foreign.lc:15:7 lambdas are `|x| expr`, or use `it` directly: `xs.map(it * 2)`
E0129 foreign.lc:16:16 lambdas are `|x| expr`, or use `it`: `xs.map(it + 1)`
E0130 foreign.lc:17:10 no macros; use `print("...{x}...")` (every string interpolates)
